        "original_id": "44330f35-03ea-5245-ab12-106f2ffcfbb2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ian Hunter, Rob Thomas\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, lead singer, record producer, multi-instrumentalist\n- Bands: Mott the Hoople, Matchbox 20\n- Places: Britain, England, America\n\nFacts:\n- Ian Hunter Patterson was born on 3 June 1939 and is known as Ian Hunter.\n- Ian Hunter is a British singer-songwriter.\n- Ian Hunter was the lead singer of the English rock band Mott the Hoople from the band's inception in 1969 until its dissolution in 1974.\n- Ian Hunter was also the lead singer of Mott the Hoople at the band's 2009 and 2013 reunions.\n- Robert Kelly Thomas was born on February 14, 1972.\n- Robert Kelly Thomas is an American singer, songwriter, record producer, and multi-instrumentalist.\n- Robert Kelly Thomas is known as Rob Thomas.\n- Rob Thomas is best known as the lead singer of the alternative band Matchbox 20.",
